    {
      "node_id": "section:7e169ef36110ab70:section-2",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-2",
        "title": "Introduccion",
        "level": 2,
        "order": 2,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": null,
        "start_line": 3,
        "end_line": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:7e169ef36110ab70:chunk-1",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-1",
        "text": "El metodo cientifico es una forma organizada de construir conocimiento mediante observacion, hipotesis, experimentacion y revision de resultados.",
        "order": 1,
        "start_line": 5,
        "end_line": 5,
        "word_count": 18,
        "character_count": 145,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:7e169ef36110ab70:section-3",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-3",
        "title": "1. Observacion",
        "level": 2,
        "order": 3,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "1",
        "start_line": 7,
        "end_line": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:7e169ef36110ab70:chunk-2",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-2",
        "text": "La observacion identifica un fenomeno o problema. En esta etapa se registran patrones, preguntas y condiciones relevantes.",
        "order": 2,
        "start_line": 9,
        "end_line": 9,
        "word_count": 17,
        "character_count": 122,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:7e169ef36110ab70:section-4",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-4",
        "title": "1.1 Hipotesis",
        "level": 3,
        "order": 4,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "1.1",
        "start_line": 11,
        "end_line": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:7e169ef36110ab70:chunk-3",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-3",
        "text": "Una hipotesis propone una explicacion tentativa. Debe poder ponerse a prueba y generar predicciones claras.",
        "order": 3,
        "start_line": 13,
        "end_line": 13,
        "word_count": 15,
        "character_count": 107,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:7e169ef36110ab70:section-5",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-5",
        "title": "1.2 Experimentacion",
        "level": 3,
        "order": 5,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "1.2",
        "start_line": 15,
        "end_line": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:7e169ef36110ab70:chunk-4",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-4",
        "text": "La experimentacion compara resultados esperados con resultados observados. Un buen experimento controla variables y permite repetir el procedimiento.",
        "order": 4,
        "start_line": 17,
        "end_line": 17,
        "word_count": 18,
        "character_count": 149,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:7e169ef36110ab70:section-6",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-6",
        "title": "2. Conclusion",
        "level": 2,
        "order": 6,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "2",
        "start_line": 19,
        "end_line": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:7e169ef36110ab70:chunk-5",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-5",
        "text": "Los temas importantes son observacion, hipotesis, evidencia, experimentacion y revision. La ciencia avanza cuando sus explicaciones pueden corregirse con nueva evidencia.",
        "order": 5,
        "start_line": 21,
        "end_line": 21,
        "word_count": 21,
        "character_count": 170,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
